@startuml
title Academic Paper route
skinparam shadowing false
actor User
participant "Host Agent" as Agent
participant "ResearchSpec CLI" as CLI
participant "academic-paper" as Paper
database "Project files" as Files
Agent -> CLI : instructions route:academic-paper:<mode>
CLI --> Agent : specs + handoff inputs\noutputs + Gates + cost
Agent -> User : confirm exact mode
User --> Agent : confirm
Agent -> CLI : start
CLI -> Files : control.yaml + handoff.md
Agent -> Paper : bounded writing or revision
alt ordinary output
  Paper -> Files : external manuscript output
else revision patch
  Paper -> Files : revision_patch
  Agent -> Files : optional stateless helper output
end
Paper -> Files : update owning handoff
Agent -> CLI : decide / advance as confirmed
@enduml
